			<div class="content" id="post-content-4773599">
									

<p>This is so long that I am not presently able to wrap together a crit for you but I hope to return. What I will say is that this is a really <em>good</em> journey that I enjoyed a lot. I'm sure there's more I could know if I were more adept or read up at the series but there was plenty here that bordered on the surreal for me to just&#8230;really enjoy reading. I don't have much more succinct feedback than that at this time.</p>
<p>Really good work. I was skeptical at the jargon upon reading the image caption and seeing &quot;Archon&quot; but the astute and direct nature of the ConProcs brought me right back in. Very glad I stayed.</p>

